{
  "$comment": "Authoritative strip registry for personalization. Each module declares everything strip-module.mjs needs to remove it: whole paths to delete, migration files (only ones headed -- MODULE: <this module>), seam fences (kit-module:<name>-begin/-end comment pairs in shared files), exact-string replacements for JSX-structural seams, env fences, doc anchors (## headings to drop from prose files), and metadata the personalize skill reads. `strategy` gradations: file-strip (default) | page-strip | keep-dormant. `schemaStrategy: leave-in-place` = the module's tables/columns live in core migrations and are never dropped. `auto.whenAllStripped` = strip this module automatically only when every listed module was stripped.",
  "modules": {
    "admin": {
      "kind": "app",
      "label": "Admin control plane app",
      "operatingCost": "A second deployed Next.js app (own hosting target + env). Without it there is no UI for users/roles/flags/audit/triage.",
      "paths": ["apps/admin/"],
      "workspacePackages": ["admin"],
      "packageJsonEdits": [],
      "migrations": [],
      "schemaStrategy": "leave-in-place",
      "flagSeeds": [],
      "featureKeys": [],
      "envVars": ["NEXT_PUBLIC_ADMIN_URL"],
      "fencedFiles": [
        "apps/portal/src/lib/app-switcher.ts",
        "apps/portal/.env.example"
      ],
      "replacements": [],
      "docAnchors": [
        { "file": "README.md", "match": "apps/admin" },
        { "file": "AGENTS.md", "match": "apps/admin" }
      ],
      "warnings": [
        "Stripping admin removes the ONLY UI for user/role/flag/audit/ticket administration. Keep it unless this fork administers users some other way.",
        "app-switcher tests reference the admin tile; apps/portal/src/lib/app-switcher.test.ts is deleted by this strip.",
        "Doc anchors are advisory: prose mentions of apps/admin in README/AGENTS.md need a manual pass."
      ],
      "extraDeletePaths": ["apps/portal/src/lib/app-switcher.test.ts"]
    },
